{"1-3":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H8451","lemma":"תּוֹרָה","tr":"to·rah","gloss":"instruction","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":219},{"base":"H6388","lemma":"פֶּ֫לֶג","tr":"pe·leg","gloss":"stream","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":10},{"base":"H8362","lemma":"שָׁתַל","tr":"sha·tal","gloss":"to transplant","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":10},{"base":"H5929","lemma":"עָלֶה","tr":"a·leh","gloss":"leaf","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":18},{"base":"H2400","lemma":"חַטָּא","tr":"chat·ta","gloss":"sinner","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":19},{"base":"H1897","lemma":"הָגָה","tr":"ha·gah","gloss":"to mutter","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":25},{"base":"H5034","lemma":"נָבַל","tr":"na·val","gloss":"be senseless","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":25},{"base":"H3887","lemma":"לִיץ","tr":"luts","gloss":"to mock","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":28},{"base":"H2656","lemma":"חֵ֫פֶץ","tr":"che·phets","gloss":"pleasure","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":39},{"base":"H4186","lemma":"מוֹשָׁב","tr":"mo·shav","gloss":"seat","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":44}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"PSA","chapter":26,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":238,"source":"openbible","text":"I do not sit with deceitful men, nor keep company with hypocrites.","from":1},{"book":"PSA","chapter":26,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":238,"source":"openbible","text":"I hate the mob of evildoers, and refuse to sit with the wicked.","from":1},{"book":"PRO","chapter":4,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":209,"source":"openbible","text":"Do not set foot on the path of the wicked or walk in the way of evildoers.","from":1},{"book":"PRO","chapter":4,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":209,"source":"openbible","text":"Avoid it; do not travel on it. Turn from it and pass on by.","from":1},{"book":"JER","chapter":17,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":175,"source":"both","text":"He is like a tree planted by the waters that sends out its roots toward the stream. It does not fear when the heat comes, and its leaves are always green. It does not worry in a year of drought, nor does it cease to produce fruit.","from":3},{"book":"PRO","chapter":13,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":149,"source":"both","text":"He who walks with the wise will become wise, but the companion of fools will be destroyed.","from":1},{"book":"PSA","chapter":119,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":122,"source":"openbible","text":"Blessed are those whose way is blameless, who walk in the Law of the LORD.","from":1},{"book":"PSA","chapter":119,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":122,"source":"openbible","text":"Blessed are those who keep His testimonies and seek Him with all their heart.","from":1}],"notes":[{"id":"ps-1-two-ways","title":"Two ways: the tree and the chaff","kind":"background"}],"groups":[]},"4-6":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H7563","lemma":"רָשָׁע","tr":"ra·sah","gloss":"wicked","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":263},{"base":"H6662","lemma":"צַדִּיק","tr":"tsad·diq","gloss":"righteous","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":206},{"base":"H4671","lemma":"מוֹץ","tr":"mots","gloss":"chaff","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"H1870","lemma":"דֶּ֫רֶךְ","tr":"de·rekh","gloss":"way: conduct","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":706},{"base":"H5086","lemma":"נָדַף","tr":"na·daph","gloss":"to drive","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":9},{"base":"H3651","lemma":"כֵּן","tr":"ken","gloss":"right","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":765},{"base":"H2400","lemma":"חַטָּא","tr":"chat·ta","gloss":"sinner","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":19},{"base":"H5712","lemma":"עֵדָה","tr":"e·dah","gloss":"congregation","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":149},{"base":"H0006","lemma":"אָבַד","tr":"a·vad","gloss":"to perish","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":184},{"base":"H7307","lemma":"רוּחַ","tr":"ru·ach","gloss":"spirit","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":378}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2TI","chapter":2,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":43,"source":"both","text":"Nevertheless, Godʼs firm foundation stands, bearing this seal: “The Lord knows those who are His,” and, “Everyone who calls on the name of the Lord must turn away from iniquity.”","from":6},{"book":"PRO","chapter":15,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":33,"source":"both","text":"The LORD detests the way of the wicked, but He loves those who pursue righteousness.","from":6},{"book":"JHN","chapter":10,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":33,"source":"both","text":"I am the good shepherd. I know My sheep and My sheep know Me,","from":6},{"book":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":31,"source":"both","text":"The LORD is good, a stronghold in the day of distress; He cares for those who trust in Him.","from":6},{"book":"JOB","chapter":21,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":29,"source":"both","text":"Are they like straw before the wind, like chaff swept away by a storm?","from":4},{"book":"PSA","chapter":5,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":25,"source":"both","text":"The boastful cannot stand in Your presence; You hate all workers of iniquity.","from":5},{"book":"PSA","chapter":37,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":25,"source":"openbible","text":"The LORD knows the days of the blameless, and their inheritance will last forever.","from":6},{"book":"PSA","chapter":37,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":25,"source":"openbible","text":"Though he falls, he will not be overwhelmed, for the LORD is holding his hand.","from":6}],"notes":[{"id":"ps-1-two-ways","title":"Two ways: the tree and the chaff","kind":"background"}],"groups":[]}}